HCC (High Command Council): [The HCC is the highest on the hierarchy in the Sogun Reich. Whomever is apart of the HCC holds commanding power over those below.
HCC Council Members: [
-Supreme Commander: Iris Raskop (female);
-Chief Strategist: Enzo Legrand (male);
-Director of Operations: Falk Kamiński (male);
-Head of Intelligence and Security: Bastian Kaczka (male)]];
